  Date : 2026-07-12 14:07:17 +0000

    Connection handling fixes

    * Removed duplicate logic for version detection * Added version hack for
    _cat/shards

    The code to discover the version of the server duplicated some logic to
    prevent an inifinte loop reusing `es_request()`. When I broke code out into
    `::Connection`, the inifinite loop was no longer possible. This removes the
    special casing and for version discovery and uses the
    `::Connection->request()` method.

    The version discovery code now fails more immediately and with better error
    messages. 

